Work in /work on the python-rts project. Continue from the counter-production implementation. Do not
  commit changes.

  Change the enemy AI so it does not launch a new attacking squad until that squad is predicted to beat
  the player squad that was last seen.

  Requirements:
  - Reuse CombatStrengthEvaluator rather than creating an unrelated unit-count comparison.
  - Compare the complete proposed red attacking squad against the persistent last-seen player squad
  snapshot.
  - Use last-observed unit kind and health; do not read current hidden player state.
  - Require a documented safety margin. Prefer the existing STRONGER_RATIO / CombatAdvantage.STRONGER
